Description: Tolome theme and settings for the Calamares installer
 Tɔlɔmɛ branding of the Calamares installer (title, logo, slideshow,
 colours) and its settings for live media built on Debian.
 .
 It replaces calamares-settings-debian: the configuration files, modules
 and helper scripts of that package are reused (GPL) and adapted. After the
 keyboard step, the installed system gets the layout chosen in Calamares
 first and "fon" second.
